        {"study_index": 16, "title": "Comparison of two vaccination programmes in preventing influenza‐related          
hospitalization among the elderly during two consecutive seasons", "abstract": "The protective effect of influenza      
vaccine against influenza related hospitalization is well established at an individual level, but the effect of         
vaccination programme at the population level is unknown. In this study we compared a risk disease-based free-of-charge 
