  population over 14 years old with indications for receiving VAG. An appointment was made for each patient who came    
  during the morning shift (intervention group), with their reference nurse, to be vaccinated and to update the PECV    
  service. CONTROL GROUP afternoon shift, vaccination as in previous years (appointments were arranged for patients on  
  a specific VAG/VAN date, attended by a different nurse each day). The coverage of the PECV service was measured in    
  both groups before and after the 2007 campaign. As well as the VAG and VAN coverage in the 2006 campaign, and         
