          {"study_index": 18, "title": "Influenza vaccination and vitamin K antagonist treatment: a                     
  placebo‐controlled, randomized, double‐blind crossover study", "abstract": "BACKGROUND Among millions of persons      
  vaccinated against influenza virus each year, many are older patients treated with several drugs, including vitamin   
