  immunogenicity."},                                                                                                    
          {"study_index": 27, "title": "Effectiveness of live, attenuated intranasal influenza virus vaccine in         
  healthy, working adults: a randomized controlled trial", "abstract": "CONTEXT Influenza virus is a major cause of     
  illness, disruption to daily life, and increased use of health care in all age groups. OBJECTIVE To assess the        
