Review: Influenza vaccines for preventing cardiovascular disease
Total studies to screen: 20

SELECTION CRITERIA:
Randomised controlled trials (RCTs) of influenza vaccination compared with placebo or no treatment in participants with 
or without cardiovascular disease, assessing cardiovascular death or non‐fatal cardiovascular events.

