  potential benefits of influenza vaccination for primary and secondary prevention of cardiovascular disease.",         
  "background": "This is an update of the original review published in 2008. The risk of adverse cardiovascular         
  outcomes is increased with influenza‐like infection, and vaccination against influenza may improve cardiovascular     
  outcomes.", "selection_criteria": "Randomised controlled trials (RCTs) of influenza vaccination compared with         
