  was associated with a lower risk of composite cardiovascular events (2.9% vs 4.7%; RR, 0.64 [95% CI, 0.48-0.86],      
  P\u2009=\u2009.003) in published trials. A treatment interaction was detected between patients with (RR, 0.45 [95%    
