  CLINICAL TRIALS REGISTRATION NCT01106196."},                                                                          
          {"study_index": 51, "title": "Safety of influenza vaccine in heart transplant recipients", "abstract":        
  "BackgroundInfluenza vaccine is recommended for heart transplant recipients, but its administration is often          
