  immunization or enrollment (if control subject). Biopsy results were evaluated with respect to vaccine response,      
  immunosuppressive regimens, and patient demographics.ResultsEighteen patients were enrolled in the single vaccine     
  trial and 10 in the booster vaccine trial. Four of 14 vaccine recipients had biopsy specimens consistent with         
  International Society for Heart and Lung Transplantation grades 2 to 3A as compared with 1 of 14 control subjects     
